# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# FUMAROLE: full one-minute original pitch progression audition.
# Source inspiration: opening atmosphere of Nicolas Godin's "Acid Lake".
# This is not its transcription, note sequence or sound recording.
notips
master 3277
press SEL
tap REC
release SEL
expect par112 62
expect ghostmode 11
expect seqcount 4
expect seqtotal 60

# Render an eight-second introduction where the slow swell/drone bed
# establishes itself before the four-position pitch progression begins.
wav fumarole-intro.wav
tap PLAY
wait 8000
press SEL
tap PLAY
release SEL
expect seqstate 1
wait 62000
wavstop
